\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Definition}
\title{Base-model endowment}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{pretraining}
\tag{post-training}

\p{The \newvocab{base-model endowment} is FTIP's name for the properties of
#{M_0} that are fixed before a specified post-training intervention. It
includes the base continuation law and its support. It also includes the
parameterization through which later gradients act and the cost of evaluating
the artifact under a declared runtime.}

\p{This is a proposed organizing notion. It is not a metric from the scaling
literature and is not assumed to reduce to pretraining loss. Task-indexed
support and performance will be defined only after tasks and evaluation
protocols have been introduced.}
